  "question": {
    "text": "If a transverse pulse is created at the topmost point of a&nbsp;uniform rope suspended vertically, then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "nM9et",
      "text": "speed of pulse remains constant.",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gmy2g",
      "text": "speed of the pulse decreases with constant rate as pulse moves downward.",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "mCjaM",
      "text": "speed of the pulse decreases with increasing rate as pulse moves downward.",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "SDuTK",
      "text": "speed of the pulse increases with constant rate as pulse moves downward.",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Tension at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mfrac><mi>gx</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μgx</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo></msqrt><msqrt><mi>gx</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><img height=\"234\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/abs/4585a744-fe34-4514-8faf-5f08bd1326f0-image.png\" width=\"132\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mrow></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><msqrt><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mi>g</mi></msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mi>g</mi></msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Thus with decrease in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>, speed of pulse will also decrease but at constant rate.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
